  (text "CC1/CC2 also go to two controller ADC pins, so the firmware can read how much current the port offers (1.5 A is needed for both radios)." (at 30 20.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 77e63463-9aef-55d9-aaf9-fc4a36d1a8aa))
  (text "The hub's port 3 is the controller; ports 1 and 2 are the radio boards; port 4 is a spare socket." (at 30 24.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd3db26f-76c1-5550-a2ee-abbd500acea5))
  (text "verify: FE1.1s strap pins against its reference design." (at 30 28.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 00bbf1e0-0333-55e9-8715-6c11d1846903))
